# secrets — never commit keys
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# local env
.env

# Pi project-local package installs (generated on startup from .pi/settings.json)
.pi/npm/

# Pi marketplace cache (cloned skill/marketplace repos, generated on startup)
.pi/git/

# pi-claude-marketplace state (marketplace clones + installed resources, regenerated by /claude:plugin import)
.pi/pi-claude-marketplace/
# marketplace-STAGED agents are regenerated from the charly marketplaces; the hand-authored
# agents (.pi/agents/omarchy-*.md, worker.md) ARE committed (plan: eval-omarchy-pi-plugin)
.pi/agents/pi-claude-marketplace-*
.pi/claude-plugins.local.json
.pi/mcp.json

# pi-fabric runtime data (mcp cache, mesh state)
.pi/fabric/

# Claude Code runtime lock (session-local, never committed)
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# plans — working docs, never committed; directory kept via .gitkeep
plan/*
!plan/.gitkeep

# Local-state classes — per-machine / per-run ephemera that live IN the project
# tree but must never be version-controlled. Modelled on charly/.gitignore (the
# same class list; charly's parity gate checks only the 5 byte-identical shared
# files, not this file), adapted to what the umbrella root actually produces:
#   .check/        — `charly check run check-all-beds` (the root roster) writes its
#                    run artifacts + NOTES.md here; without this the root tree reads
#                    dirty after every roster run (and risks an accidental commit of
#                    per-run state). NOTE: `charly task verify` does NOT check the
#                    root tree — it asserts each SUBMODULE's cleanliness — so this is
#                    about an honest root `git status`, not a gate.
#   .build/        — generated Containerfiles from `charly box generate`.
#   .opencharly/   — deploy-state output from `charly deploy add`.
#   scratchpad/    — per-session temporary files.
#   .claude/worktrees/ — per-session linked feature worktrees (a session's own
#                    lifecycle; the main tree stays on `main`).
#   bin/           — a worktree-local built binary.
.check/
.build/
.opencharly/
scratchpad/
.claude/worktrees/
bin/
*.sync-conflict-*
